 *
 * Wiring contracts covered here:
 *   - developTicketAndCreatePR.js (dev leg) consumes the helper;
 *   - pushReworkChanges.js (rework leg) consumes the helper;
 *   - the fa dev/rework runner configs (.dmtools/runners/) carry the dart
