}
``

CRAP estimate: dsSandbox — 6 ifs → comp ~7, all covered (each fixture exercised by some test; the noHostDart path is in dsSandboxEnv). dsSandboxEnv: 2-3 branches, both covered. dsRun: trailTarget branches — trail tests cover both. Should be under 8 now.

Note: dsSandboxEnv mutates sandbox.lines and env. Fine.

